{"seq":1,"slug":"staff-notation","title":"五线谱系统详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/staff-notation","wordCount":1419,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"五线谱系统详解\">五线谱系统详解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>五线谱本身不含音高</strong>：是谱号赋予了各线各间明确的音名——高音谱号（G）标第二线为 G4，低音谱号（F）标第四线为 F3，中音谱号（C）指定某线为 C4。</li>\n<li><strong>音符编码两个维度</strong>：位置决定音高，形态（符头/符干/符尾）决定时值。</li>\n<li><strong>时值以二分递归为基础</strong>：全音符逐级二分，附点延长一半（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times\\frac{3}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>），双附点延长四分之三（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times\\frac{7}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>临时记号与调号作用范围不同</strong>：临时记号仅在本小节有效，调号对整曲持续有效。</li>\n<li><strong>附加符号传达演奏细节</strong>：连线连接同音高、圆滑线覆盖不同音高组，力度记号从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ppp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ppp</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">fff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 分级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"谱表与谱号\">谱表与谱号</h2><p>五线谱（Staff Notation）由五条等距水平线构成，音符在线上或线间的位置确定其音高。空白的五线谱本身不具有固定的音高含义——是<strong>谱号</strong>（Clef）赋予了各线各间明确的音名。</p>\n<p>三种主要谱号：</p>\n<p><strong>高音谱号（G 谱号）</strong>：起笔于第二线，标记该线为 G4。用于演奏音域较高的乐器——钢琴右手、小提琴、长笛、人声高音部。</p>\n<p><strong>低音谱号（F 谱号）</strong>：两个点夹住第四线，标记该线为 F3。用于演奏音域较低的乐器——钢琴左手、大提琴、低音提琴、巴松管。</p>\n<p><strong>中音谱号（C 谱号）</strong>：箭头指向哪一线，那一线就是 C4（中央 C）。最常见的是指向第三线的中音谱号（Viola 谱号）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;五线谱系统&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;高音谱号 G&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;低音谱号 F&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;中音谱号 C&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;第二线 = G4&lt;br/&gt;用于高音域乐器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;第四线 = F3&lt;br/&gt;用于低音域乐器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;指定线 = C4&lt;br/&gt;用于中音域乐器&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"五线谱系统\"] --&gt; B[\"高音谱号 G\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"低音谱号 F\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"中音谱号 C\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"第二线 = G4&lt;br/&gt;用于高音域乐器\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"第四线 = F3&lt;br/&gt;用于低音域乐器\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"指定线 = C4&lt;br/&gt;用于中音域乐器\"]</pre><h2 id=\"音符与休止符系统\">音符与休止符系统</h2><p>五线谱中的每个音符包含两个信息维度：<strong>位置</strong>（决定音高）与<strong>形态</strong>（决定时值）。</p>\n<p>音符形态通过符头（实心/空心）、符干（有/无）、符尾（数量）的组合来编码时值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音符名称</th>\n<th>符头</th>\n<th>符干</th>\n<th>符尾数</th>\n<th>时值（4/4拍中）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全音符</td>\n<td>空心</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>4 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分音符</td>\n<td>空心</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四分音符</td>\n<td>实心</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八分音符</td>\n<td>实心</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1/2 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>十六分音符</td>\n<td>实心</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1/4 拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三十二分音符</td>\n<td>实心</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1/8 拍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每种音符都有对应的休止符，休止符表示等长的静默时间。休止符在音乐中不是&quot;空白&quot;而是结构的一部分——控制音乐的呼吸与留白。</p>\n<p>附点规则：音符后加一个点，时值延长原时值的一半：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>附点音符时值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>原时值</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{附点音符时值} = \\text{原时值} \\times \\frac{3}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">附点音符时值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原时值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>双附点音符时值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>原时值</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{双附点音符时值} = \\text{原时值} \\times \\frac{7}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">双附点音符时值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原时值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"临时记号与调号\">临时记号与调号</h2><p>临时记号（Accidentals）用于在乐谱中标记临时的升降变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>♯（升号）</strong>：将音高升高一个半音</li>\n<li><strong>♭（降号）</strong>：将音高降低一个半音</li>\n<li><strong>♮（还原号）</strong>：取消之前的升降，回到自然音</li>\n<li><strong>𝄪（重升号）</strong>：升高两个半音</li>\n<li><strong>𝄫（重降号）</strong>：降低两个半音</li>\n</ul>\n<p>临时记号的有效范围：从标注位置开始，到该小节结束为止。跨小节需要重新标注。</p>\n<p>调号（Key Signature）则是放在谱号之后、拍号之前的升降号组合，对整首乐曲中的特定音名施加持续的升降效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 记号有效范围&#10;        A[&quot;调号&lt;br/&gt;整曲有效&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;临时记号&lt;br/&gt;本小节有效&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;加括号提示&lt;br/&gt;(courtesy accidental)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 记号有效范围\n        A[\"调号&lt;br/&gt;整曲有效\"] --&gt; B[\"临时记号&lt;br/&gt;本小节有效\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"加括号提示&lt;br/&gt;(courtesy accidental)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"连线-圆滑线与表情记号\">连线、圆滑线与表情记号</h2><p>五线谱使用多种附加符号来传达演奏细节：</p>\n<p><strong>连线（Tie）</strong>：连接两个相同音高的音符，使它们合并为一个持续时值。视觉上是连接两个同高度音符的弧线。</p>\n<p><strong>圆滑线（Slur）</strong>：覆盖一组不同音高的音符，表示这些音符应连贯演奏（legato），不在音与音之间断开。</p>\n<p>区分连线与圆滑线：连线连接<strong>同音高</strong>的音符，圆滑线覆盖<strong>不同音高</strong>的音符组。</p>\n<p><strong>力度记号</strong>从弱到强排列：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ppp &lt; pp &lt; p &lt; mp &lt; mf &lt; f &lt; ff &lt; fff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ppp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记号</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>相对强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ppp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ppp</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>pianississimo</td>\n<td>极弱</td>\n<td>最轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>pianissimo</td>\n<td>很弱</td>\n<td>很轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>piano</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>mezzo-piano</td>\n<td>中弱</td>\n<td>略轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>mezzo-forte</td>\n<td>中强</td>\n<td>略响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>forte</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>fortissimo</td>\n<td>很强</td>\n<td>很响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">fff</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>fortississimo</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>最响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大谱表与总谱编排\">大谱表与总谱编排</h2><p>钢琴等音域宽广的乐器使用<strong>大谱表</strong>（Grand Staff）——高音谱表与低音谱表通过花括号连接，中间用加线补充中央 C 区域。</p>\n<p>管弦乐总谱（Full Score）按照从高到低的音域顺序排列各乐器声部：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>木管组：长笛、双簧管、单簧管、巴松管</li>\n<li>铜管组：圆号、小号、长号、大号</li>\n<li>打击乐组</li>\n<li>键盘/竖琴</li>\n<li>弦乐组：第一小提琴、第二小提琴、中提琴、大提琴、低音提琴</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 管弦乐总谱排列&#10;        W[&quot;木管组(最高)&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;铜管组&quot;]&#10;        P[&quot;打击乐组&quot;]&#10;        K[&quot;键盘/竖琴&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;弦乐组(最低)&quot;]&#10;        W --&gt; B --&gt; P --&gt; K --&gt; S&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 管弦乐总谱排列\n        W[\"木管组(最高)\"]\n        B[\"铜管组\"]\n        P[\"打击乐组\"]\n        K[\"键盘/竖琴\"]\n        S[\"弦乐组(最低)\"]\n        W --&gt; B --&gt; P --&gt; K --&gt; S\n    end</pre><p>在现代音乐制作中，五线谱仍然是古典音乐录制、影视配乐写作与专业音乐教育的标准交流格式。Sibelius、Finale、MuseScore、Dorico 等记谱软件在 2025 年的功能竞争中各有侧重——Dorico 以排版美观著称，MuseScore 4 以开源免费获得广泛采用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>五线谱的音高含义由谱号赋予，高音、低音、中音三种谱号覆盖不同音域。</li>\n<li>每个音符由位置（音高）与形态（时值）两个维度编码，时值遵循二分递归与附点规则。</li>\n<li>临时记号仅限本小节，调号则对整曲中的特定音名持续生效。</li>\n<li>连线与圆滑线分别处理同音高连接与不同音高组的连贯演奏，力度记号构成从极弱到极强的分级体系。</li>\n<li>大谱表与总谱按音域高低排列声部，五线谱至今仍是专业音乐领域的通用交流格式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"五线谱系统详解","id":"五线谱系统详解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"谱表与谱号","id":"谱表与谱号"},{"level":2,"text":"音符与休止符系统","id":"音符与休止符系统"},{"level":2,"text":"临时记号与调号","id":"临时记号与调号"},{"level":2,"text":"连线、圆滑线与表情记号","id":"连线-圆滑线与表情记号"},{"level":2,"text":"大谱表与总谱编排","id":"大谱表与总谱编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"速度标记与节拍器应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/time-signatures-tempo/tempo-markings"},"next":{"title":"简谱记谱法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/numbered-notation"}}